-# change; CMD's own code when it fails.
+# change; 3 when the probe is inconclusive (its first line printed, nothing written); CMD's own code
+# when it fails (stderr then says "command exited <n>").
 # Adapted from superpowers executing-plans/scripts/task-done (MIT).
